cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the version you used, using the metadata below."
title: "Renesis: Low-Energy Circuit Synthesis"
abstract: >-
  Energy-aware synthesis for adiabatic and reversible logic.  Renesis accepts
  an ordinary irreversible netlist and produces a verified, technology-mapped
  energy-recovery circuit, with energy rather than area or delay as the
  optimization criterion.  Every transformation is equivalence-checked against
  the original netlist before its effect on energy is measured.
